              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{27^{x}-3\\cdot 9^{x+1}+3^{x+5}-729}{50x^{2}+10x+0{,}5}\\le 0\"></span>. </p>",
